\[p(f^{*} \mid y) = \mathcal{N}\left(\mu_{*} + K_{*}(K + \sigma^2 I)^{-1}(y-\mu), \,\,
K_{**}-K_{*}(K + \sigma^2 I)^{-1}K_{*}^T \right)
\]
